Documents
-----------------------------------------------------
# Here we have three documents:

tool: yaml
version: 1.2
awesome: true
nothing: null
duplicateKeys: not allowed
---
This is a new document
---
One file can contain multiple documents

# Note that we cannot have two of the same key and pair values.
document: one
tool: yaml
version: 1.2
awesome: true
nothing: null
duplicateKeys: not allowed
---
document: two
key: value
key: value

# Just create another document.

document: one
key: value
---
document: two
key: value



